    "detailed_description": "<strong>Dream Bar Simulator</strong> is a next-gen simulator game where you take on the role of a bar owner in a small town.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174950/extras/f34d8d1875974b38eb635dcc3a36e7d7.avif?t=1747941235\" width=450 height=100 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174950/extras/debd9d7a9de00f8a534710cc9eaf45d6.poster.avif?t=1747941235\" width=600 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174950/extras/debd9d7a9de00f8a534710cc9eaf45d6.webm?t=1747941235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174950/extras/debd9d7a9de00f8a534710cc9eaf45d6.mp4?t=1747941235\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Build your menu from a variety of available recipes or create your own. Make quality drinks to keep the customer happy. High-quality drinks lead to happier customers, bigger tips, and a better reputation for your bar. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174950/extras/c1d068ee437d218aa02a814343b7ac5f.avif?t=1747941235\" width=450 height=100 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174950/extras/30dacca1147e6b252ed544cec8be42ec.poster.avif?t=1747941235\" width=600 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174950/extras/30dacca1147e6b252ed544cec8be42ec.webm?t=1747941235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174950/extras/30dacca1147e6b252ed544cec8be42ec.mp4?t=1747941235\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>In the world of Dream Bar Simulator, you'll find a huge variety of resources to keep your bar stocked. From different alcohol and consumables to furniture and decorations, order goods online or shop local depending on the situation. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174950/extras/6a1ba0879a78eb139d1478c402d176b7.avif?t=1747941235\" width=450 height=100 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174950/extras/421fcdd327eebf86a37306fe187566db.poster.avif?t=1747941235\" width=600 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174950/extras/421fcdd327eebf86a37306fe187566db.webm?t=1747941235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174950/extras/421fcdd327eebf86a37306fe187566db.mp4?t=1747941235\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Make your dream bar a reality! Express your unique vision with powerful customization tools. Craft the perfect ambiance to attract the clientele you desire.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174950/extras/344d7a858ef8be20d8741fc17ce5aa1c.avif?t=1747941235\" width=450 height=100 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174950/extras/ec7ecb123eb1c0fd11c56194382e58be.poster.avif?t=1747941235\" width=600 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174950/extras/ec7ecb123eb1c0fd11c56194382e58be.webm?t=1747941235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174950/extras/ec7ecb123eb1c0fd11c56194382e58be.mp4?t=1747941235\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Delegate tasks and build your dream team! Hire everything from bartenders and servers to security and cleaning staff.  Choose wisely - each potential employee comes with a unique background, personality, and skillset. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174950/extras/b89a98550e7749243d1ec29f7161b19f.avif?t=1747941235\" width=450 height=100 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174950/extras/bb31b3250b0770bb0cf21e8be1b9ceb7.poster.avif?t=1747941235\" width=600 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174950/extras/bb31b3250b0770bb0cf21e8be1b9ceb7.webm?t=1747941235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174950/extras/bb31b3250b0770bb0cf21e8be1b9ceb7.mp4?t=1747941235\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>As your bar thrives, expand your territory! Increase your capacity, rake in more profits, and become the hottest spot in town.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Huge selection of drinks and ingredients<br></li><li>Craft original cocktail recipes<br></li><li>Varying drink complexity levels for an extra challenge<br></li><li>Design a unique menu to reflect your bar's style<br></li><li>Recruit staff with unique characteristics and backstories<br></li><li>Deep bar customization options<br></li><li>Maintain order and cleanliness (or don't!)<br></li><li>Deal with drunk customers and the occasional bar brawl! </li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Dream Bar Simulator</strong> is a next-gen simulator game where you take on the role of a bar owner in a small town.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174950/extras/f34d8d1875974b38eb635dcc3a36e7d7.avif?t=1747941235\" width=450 height=100 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174950/extras/debd9d7a9de00f8a534710cc9eaf45d6.poster.avif?t=1747941235\" width=600 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174950/extras/debd9d7a9de00f8a534710cc9eaf45d6.webm?t=1747941235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174950/extras/debd9d7a9de00f8a534710cc9eaf45d6.mp4?t=1747941235\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Build your menu from a variety of available recipes or create your own. Make quality drinks to keep the customer happy. High-quality drinks lead to happier customers, bigger tips, and a better reputation for your bar. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174950/extras/c1d068ee437d218aa02a814343b7ac5f.avif?t=1747941235\" width=450 height=100 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174950/extras/30dacca1147e6b252ed544cec8be42ec.poster.avif?t=1747941235\" width=600 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174950/extras/30dacca1147e6b252ed544cec8be42ec.webm?t=1747941235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174950/extras/30dacca1147e6b252ed544cec8be42ec.mp4?t=1747941235\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>In the world of Dream Bar Simulator, you'll find a huge variety of resources to keep your bar stocked. From different alcohol and consumables to furniture and decorations, order goods online or shop local depending on the situation. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174950/extras/6a1ba0879a78eb139d1478c402d176b7.avif?t=1747941235\" width=450 height=100 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174950/extras/421fcdd327eebf86a37306fe187566db.poster.avif?t=1747941235\" width=600 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174950/extras/421fcdd327eebf86a37306fe187566db.webm?t=1747941235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174950/extras/421fcdd327eebf86a37306fe187566db.mp4?t=1747941235\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Make your dream bar a reality! Express your unique vision with powerful customization tools. Craft the perfect ambiance to attract the clientele you desire.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174950/extras/344d7a858ef8be20d8741fc17ce5aa1c.avif?t=1747941235\" width=450 height=100 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174950/extras/ec7ecb123eb1c0fd11c56194382e58be.poster.avif?t=1747941235\" width=600 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174950/extras/ec7ecb123eb1c0fd11c56194382e58be.webm?t=1747941235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174950/extras/ec7ecb123eb1c0fd11c56194382e58be.mp4?t=1747941235\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Delegate tasks and build your dream team! Hire everything from bartenders and servers to security and cleaning staff.  Choose wisely - each potential employee comes with a unique background, personality, and skillset. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174950/extras/b89a98550e7749243d1ec29f7161b19f.avif?t=1747941235\" width=450 height=100 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174950/extras/bb31b3250b0770bb0cf21e8be1b9ceb7.poster.avif?t=1747941235\" width=600 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174950/extras/bb31b3250b0770bb0cf21e8be1b9ceb7.webm?t=1747941235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174950/extras/bb31b3250b0770bb0cf21e8be1b9ceb7.mp4?t=1747941235\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>As your bar thrives, expand your territory! Increase your capacity, rake in more profits, and become the hottest spot in town.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Huge selection of drinks and ingredients<br></li><li>Craft original cocktail recipes<br></li><li>Varying drink complexity levels for an extra challenge<br></li><li>Design a unique menu to reflect your bar's style<br></li><li>Recruit staff with unique characteristics and backstories<br></li><li>Deep bar customization options<br></li><li>Maintain order and cleanliness (or don't!)<br></li><li>Deal with drunk customers and the occasional bar brawl! </li></ul>",
